<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Volcano Global | Import, Export & International Trading</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Volcano Global provides international import, export, trading, cargo coordination, sourcing and business-to-business support.">
  <style>
    *{box-sizing:border-box}
    body{margin:0;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;color:#18202a;background:#f7f8fa;line-height:1.6}
    header{background:#111827;color:white;padding:70px 20px;text-align:center}
    header h1{font-size:48px;margin:0 0 10px;letter-spacing:1px}
    header p{font-size:20px;margin:0;color:#dbe4ee}
    .container{max-width:1100px;margin:auto;padding:55px 20px}
    h2{font-size:32px;margin-top:0}
    .intro{font-size:18px;color:#4b5563}
    .cards{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(220px,1fr));gap:20px;margin-top:30px}
    .card{background:white;padding:25px;border-radius:14px;box-shadow:0 5px 20px rgba(0,0,0,.07)}
    .card h3{margin-top:0}
    .contact{background:#111827;color:white}
    .contact h2{color:white}
    .contact-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(260px,1fr));gap:25px}
    .contact-box{background:#1f2937;padding:25px;border-radius:14px}
    a{color:#8ec5ff;text-decoration:none}
    footer{text-align:center;background:#0b1220;color:#b8c2cf;padding:25px}
    .tag{display:inline-block;margin-top:25px;padding:10px 18px;border:1px solid #718096;border-radius:30px;color:#fff}
  </style>
</head>
<body>

<header>
  <h1>VOLCANO GLOBAL</h1>
  <p>Connecting Markets. Creating Opportunities. Moving Business Forward.</p>
  <span class="tag">Import • Export • Trading • Cargo</span>
</header>

<main>
  <section class="container">
    <h2>About Us</h2>
    <p class="intro">
      Volcano Global is an international import, export, trading, and cargo company focused on
      connecting trusted suppliers, manufacturers, and clients across Africa, the Middle East,
      Asia, and international markets.
    </p>
    <p>
      We provide professional import and export services, international trade solutions,
      cargo coordination, sourcing, and business-to-business support. Our goal is to make
      international commerce easier, more reliable, and more efficient for our clients and
      business partners.
    </p>
    <p>
      With business contacts in Lagos, Nigeria, and Beirut, Lebanon, we are strategically
      positioned to support clients and partners across different markets.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="container">
    <h2>Our Services</h2>
    <div class="cards">
      <div class="card"><h3>Import & Export</h3><p>International trade support for products and business partners.</p></div>
      <div class="card"><h3>International Trading</h3><p>Connecting buyers and suppliers across global markets.</p></div>
      <div class="card"><h3>Cargo & Logistics</h3><p>Coordination and support for international cargo movements.</p></div>
      <div class="card"><h3>Product Sourcing</h3><p>Helping clients identify suitable products and suppliers.</p></div>
      <div class="card"><h3>Supplier & Buyer Connections</h3><p>Building reliable B2B relationships and trade opportunities.</p></div>
      <div class="card"><h3>Client Support</h3><p>Professional communication and assistance throughout the trade process.</p></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="container">
    <h2>Our Mission</h2>
    <p class="intro">Our mission is to build strong, long-term business relationships by providing reliable trade solutions, professional communication, and efficient support from supplier to client.</p>

    <h2 style="margin-top:45px">Our Vision</h2>
    <p class="intro">To become a trusted international trading and logistics partner, connecting businesses and opportunities across Africa, the Middle East, and global markets.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="contact">
    <div class="container">
      <h2>Contact Us</h2>
      <div class="contact-grid">
        <div class="contact-box">
          <h3>Nigeria Office</h3>
          <p>Festac Town, Lagos, Nigeria</p>
          <p>Tel: <a href="tel:+2349030000040">+234 903 000 0040</a></p>
        </div>
        <div class="contact-box">
          <h3>Lebanon Office</h3>
          <p>Beirut, Lebanon</p>
          <p>Tel: <a href="tel:+96179181278">+961 79 181 278</a></p>
        </div>
        <div class="contact-box">
          <h3>Email</h3>
          <p><a href="mailto:sales@volcanoglobal.com">sales@volcanoglobal.com</a></p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</main>

<footer>
  © 2026 Volcano Global. All Rights Reserved.
</footer>

</body>
</html>
